      "id": "2060301936688066891",
      "text": "RT @XFreeze: Elon Musk on the physics of truth:\n\n“Truth is not an easy thing\n\nBut you can aspire to the truth. You can try to get as close…",
      "created_at": "Fri May 29 10:07:14 +0000 2026",
